{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_title", "source_sha256": "733e105e85d7622bd2c6ca9ca2ca3bfa76e74b726805c2794906f3c3e0f3d5e6", "ja": "Re:FLAME #1 留守電", "zh": "Re:FLAME #1 留言电话", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "27f5357d9791aec9cfa27434aaed91a7e76175526484b0d3d1ecb0ea2b581e4d", "ja": "京都での公演を無事に終えた\n美希からの留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是美希在京都的公演顺利结束后留下的语音留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "2fb22da98663e5b8fbf5dc4352c9124d28a27f0f98606afbafe8855eee8f58f9", "ja": "むぅ、留守電になっちゃったの。\n寝る前にハニーとお話ししたかったのに～。", "zh": "唔，变成留言信箱了。\n人家明明想在睡前跟亲爱的聊聊天的嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "472d81752301145d768664d927d19e8eadd579a469211a571bfc8ef13f9b8d1e", "ja": "あっ、でも留守電なら、\nミキの声、後で何回も聞いてもらえるよね？", "zh": "啊，不过如果是语音留言的话，\n你之后可以把美希的声音听好多遍了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "5b35c6d0269f24bd6b8f1309bb911b7e9954ea7e142842b292fd50be3f52999d", "ja": "……あはっ、お疲れ様♪　ミキなの～。\n京都でのライブ、1日目が終わったよ。", "zh": "……啊哈哈，辛苦啦♪　我是美希～。\n在京都的演出，第1天结束了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "1524db1f56bab678d3248ca9664c06917be5df0618dada1ec99c1825006dda39", "ja": "ミキ的には、悪くなかったっていうかー、\nすっごく良かったって思うな☆", "zh": "在美希看来，不能说不好吧——\n我觉得真的特别棒呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "db284386b795c71e0eff9aae32385bec6ba3a2bb65314484266b3218682e9f12", "ja": "貴音と響と3人のライブって新鮮だったし、\nファンの人たちも盛り上がってたし～……。", "zh": "和贵音、响以及3人一起的演唱会很新鲜，\n粉丝们也都很热闹～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "8815463b65cb89d0d1cb6bc3d047e89b0f38a79c301c8c47cb7ccf6e7880cd55", "ja": "ライブの空気も、いつもとは違ってて……。\nセトリも、攻めた感じで……むにゃ……。", "zh": "演唱会的氛围也和平时不一样……  \n曲目安排也感觉很大胆……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "1c3e214ef10893f396564ffb446bc2d031fb702b4be620c92d59d129b3381132", "ja": "すー……す……", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "7ef8505193a72359197d012e088ec37c159b86c01bda8b6b69c81a1875a4f224", "ja": "あっ！　ごめんね、ミキ、ウトウトしちゃった。\nそういえば今日、お昼寝してなくて。", "zh": "啊！对不起，美希不小心打了个盹。\n说起来今天都还没睡午觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "654f7853c00204b0ef1e55583d6aa9e4a0cfc73d6bf15b36407ef570fe01adb9", "ja": "朝からずーーーっと、リハと打ち合わせしてて。\n気がついたら本番直前だったの。", "zh": "从早上开始一直——都在排练和开会。\n回过神来，都已经是正式演出前一刻了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "a2ee6cb82f34c7186c6ed1a014fa7c2d2d95865633a4326f5720f10b7eee99f7", "ja": "今回、貴音も響もすっごく張り切ってたから、\nミキも引っぱり込まれたのかも。", "zh": "这次贵音和响都干劲十足，可能美希也被她们带动起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "3e11233101d72b283651cf522de4c7267f08f057ea404683b214eae520c42541", "ja": "一緒に夢中になっちゃって、\n眠くなるヒマもなかったってカンジ。", "zh": "不知不觉就一起投入进去了，感觉根本没空犯困。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "75be58755fee0fb27367f33e0b1957201c3cced0e9f470344e33a9b1dd372112", "ja": "その分、ライブはすっごく盛り上がったけど～……\nさすがにもう限界だから、おにぎり食べて寝るね。", "zh": "不过，演唱会也因此嗨到不行～……\n但我真的已经到极限了，要吃个饭团睡觉啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "f6e2d4718976f2bc338efdba8aea30c6b3620deeab8c23de045af3202a5fe382", "ja": "えっとね。明日の公演も、\nミキは一生懸命、そこそこ頑張るから～……。", "zh": "那个呢。明天的公演，美希也会拼尽全力，稍微努力一下的～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_516_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_516_rs_02_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "d0688d60bdd07b969a5f6daa6cf447725a353f3918b66c9bb71e6f623082e609", "ja": "お話の続きは、ミキの夢の中で……しよ？　あはっ♪\nそれじゃ、おやすみなさいなの～……、すー……。", "zh": "故事的后续，去美希的梦里……继续聊，好吗？啊哈♪\n那么，晚安啦～……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
